FOR RUN THE PROJECT FOR VENDOR FOLDER

Note - after clone the project then go the project directory and then remove the git file.

FOR WINDOW SYTEM : 
Remove-Item -Recurse -Force .git
git status


FOR LINUX SYSTEM :
rm -rf .git
git status


For window terminal history check and remove 

Get-Content (Get-PSReadLineOption).HistorySavePath               :  get history 
Remove-Item (Get-PSReadLineOption).HistorySavePath -Force         : Delete permanantly history
Get-Content (Get-PSReadLineOption).HistorySavePath               : again check 
Remove-Item (Get-PSReadLineOption).HistorySavePath -Force         : Delete permanantly history



For linux/ubuntu

cat ~/.bash_history        : get history  
rm ~/.bash_history         : Delete permanantly history
cat ~/.bash_history        : again check  
rm ~/.bash_history         : Delete permanantly history
